WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.075
Step 1. Open the schedule.

1.2
00:00:02.075 --> 00:00:07.481
A session is a block of time on chosen weekdays that Care divides into slots.

1.3
00:00:07.481 --> 00:00:12.263
Select Services, the service, then Schedule under Scheduling.

2.1
00:00:12.263 --> 00:00:17.121
Step 2. Open the template. Select the pencil icon on the template card.

2.2
00:00:17.121 --> 00:00:20.366
The sheet lists the sessions under Availabilities,

2.3
00:00:20.366 --> 00:00:24.370
each with its Slot Configuration and Session Capacity.

3.1
00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:26.452
Step 3. Remove a session.

3.2
00:00:26.452 --> 00:00:31.067
You cannot change a saved session, so remove the old one first.

3.3
00:00:31.067 --> 00:00:33.631
Select the trash icon, then Delete.

3.4
00:00:33.631 --> 00:00:38.087
Care shows Schedule availability deleted successfully.

4.1
00:00:38.087 --> 00:00:40.262
Step 4. Start a new session.

4.2
00:00:40.262 --> 00:00:44.317
Select Add another session, and the New Session form opens,

4.3
00:00:44.317 --> 00:00:48.117
ready for the session that replaces the old one.

5.1
00:00:48.117 --> 00:00:50.816
Step 5. Enter the session details.

5.2
00:00:50.816 --> 00:00:55.930
Fill in the Session Title, Start Time, End Time, Slot duration (mins.),

5.3
00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:58.163
Patients per Slot and Weekdays.

5.4
00:00:58.163 --> 00:01:03.634
The new session must not overlap another session on the same weekday.

6.1
00:01:03.634 --> 00:01:06.649
Step 6. Create the session. Select Create.

6.2
00:01:06.649 --> 00:01:09.612
Care shows Availability created successfully,

6.3
00:01:09.612 --> 00:01:14.879
and offers slots from the new session on its weekdays within the valid period of

6.4
00:01:14.879 --> 00:01:16.234
the template.
